secp256k1 signature by the Bitcoin (2026) genesis key over the SHA-256 of
CHAIN_SOURCE_MANIFEST.json.

  message signed   62ba1cee54f26cf5a17070be6a7389818e75e2069d043a4f4828724606855beb
                   (the ASCII hex string above, 64 characters -- NOT the raw digest bytes)
  public key       04c0414cfdcc009830708543b06e43a03570dc1ffa45ddf98657045e594a815eba7
